#: toplevel.cpp:53
msgid "The application finder looks for non-KDE applications on your system and adds them to the KDE menu system. Click 'Scan' to begin, select the desired applications and then click 'Apply'."
msgstr "Qullanma ezläwçese sistemıñdağa KDEğa qaramağan qullanmalar ezläp alarnı KDE sistemına östi. Başlar öçen \"Tara\" bas, telägän qullanmalarnı saylap \"Aşır\" bas."

